    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786290/extras/624dde09cfeef6bb1e49be05d2de5244.avif?t=1743455874\" data-has-big width=800 height=421 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786290/extras/0a191ae6a8f60da0d224600d942b7b61.poster.avif?t=1743455874\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786290/extras/0a191ae6a8f60da0d224600d942b7b61.webm?t=1743455874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786290/extras/0a191ae6a8f60da0d224600d942b7b61.mp4?t=1743455874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kaia's Ascent is a first-person speedrunning platforming game all about running, climbing and charge-punching your way out of the deep, dark Abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786290/extras/3f010ab597a4701c14492b9364312d3c.avif?t=1743455874\" data-has-big width=800 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786290/extras/dfb520759189256594b09589ece09f62.poster.avif?t=1743455874\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786290/extras/dfb520759189256594b09589ece09f62.webm?t=1743455874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786290/extras/dfb520759189256594b09589ece09f62.mp4?t=1743455874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, fluid, freestyle  movement mechanics that'll test your reflexes and platforming abilities, and have you coming back again and again to achieve faster times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 challenging levels, each with record times to beat and hidden collectibles to find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story cutscenes, conversations, and data logs that flesh out the characters and their surrounding world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro PSX art style inspired by late 90's-early 2000's classics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack of old-school-inspired drum and bass/jungle music.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786290/extras/1ad6c2bcb0ba4ee38e014ab295bb7e50.avif?t=1743455874\" data-has-big width=800 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786290/extras/54328dc1df452b51ec89551eb829d854.poster.avif?t=1743455874\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786290/extras/54328dc1df452b51ec89551eb829d854.webm?t=1743455874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786290/extras/54328dc1df452b51ec89551eb829d854.mp4?t=1743455874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Kaia, a brash fox girl stranded deep underground in the Abyss, determined to get out with the help of a mysterious guardian and a power fist that sends you rocketing through the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standing in your way is Dark Matter, the terrifying, insatiable hivemind plaguing the Abyss. It's out to get you, whether via deadly lasers or its matter plaguing the landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you tough enough to escape the deep, harrowing Abyss, and take down a terrifying alien threat in the process? And just who exactly is that mysterious guardian aiding you?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786290/extras/624dde09cfeef6bb1e49be05d2de5244.avif?t=1743455874\" data-has-big width=800 height=421 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786290/extras/0a191ae6a8f60da0d224600d942b7b61.poster.avif?t=1743455874\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786290/extras/0a191ae6a8f60da0d224600d942b7b61.webm?t=1743455874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786290/extras/0a191ae6a8f60da0d224600d942b7b61.mp4?t=1743455874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kaia's Ascent is a first-person speedrunning platforming game all about running, climbing and charge-punching your way out of the deep, dark Abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786290/extras/3f010ab597a4701c14492b9364312d3c.avif?t=1743455874\" data-has-big width=800 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786290/extras/dfb520759189256594b09589ece09f62.poster.avif?t=1743455874\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786290/extras/dfb520759189256594b09589ece09f62.webm?t=1743455874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786290/extras/dfb520759189256594b09589ece09f62.mp4?t=1743455874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, fluid, freestyle  movement mechanics that'll test your reflexes and platforming abilities, and have you coming back again and again to achieve faster times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 challenging levels, each with record times to beat and hidden collectibles to find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story cutscenes, conversations, and data logs that flesh out the characters and their surrounding world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro PSX art style inspired by late 90's-early 2000's classics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack of old-school-inspired drum and bass/jungle music.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786290/extras/1ad6c2bcb0ba4ee38e014ab295bb7e50.avif?t=1743455874\" data-has-big width=800 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786290/extras/54328dc1df452b51ec89551eb829d854.poster.avif?t=1743455874\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786290/extras/54328dc1df452b51ec89551eb829d854.webm?t=1743455874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786290/extras/54328dc1df452b51ec89551eb829d854.mp4?t=1743455874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Kaia, a brash fox girl stranded deep underground in the Abyss, determined to get out with the help of a mysterious guardian and a power fist that sends you rocketing through the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standing in your way is Dark Matter, the terrifying, insatiable hivemind plaguing the Abyss. It's out to get you, whether via deadly lasers or its matter plaguing the landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you tough enough to escape the deep, harrowing Abyss, and take down a terrifying alien threat in the process? And just who exactly is that mysterious guardian aiding you?</p>",
